        {
            "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
            "body": "> Probably need `follow = true` in `runtime/lua/vim/_core/exrc.lua` so that it still finds symlinked `.nvim.lua` .\r\n\r\nDouble-checked and did not find any other place where `follow = true` would be missing. Thank you!",
